        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 200000\n    old_interest_rate = 0.05\n    new_interest_rate = 0.035\n    remaining_term_years = 20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    monthly_rate = new_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = remaining_term_years * 12\n\n    new_payment = (\n        principal\n        * monthly_rate\n        * (1 + monthly_rate) ** total_payments\n        / ((1 + monthly_rate) ** total_payments - 1)\n    )\n\n    answer = round(new_payment, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
